===============================================================================
DEFAULT.OPTIONS — Quick Reference for External Parameters
This file is documentation only. The C program does NOT read this file.
It lists all parameters that can be modified externally (CLI or YAML),
their flags, YAML keys, default values, and short descriptions.
===============================================================================


------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SIMULATION CONTROL OPTIONS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Dust drift
  CLI:       -drift <0|1>
  YAML:      enable_dust_drift
  Default:   1.0
  Info:      Enable (1) or disable (0) dust radial drift.

Dust growth
  CLI:       -growth <0|1>
  YAML:      enable_dust_growth
  Default:   1.0
  Info:      Enable (1) or disable (0) dust growth.

Gas evolution
  CLI:       -evol <0|1>
  YAML:      enable_gas_evolution
  Default:   1.0
  Info:      Enable (1) or disable (0) gas surface density evolution.

Two-population dust model
  CLI:       -twopop <0|1>
  YAML:      enable_two_dust_populations
  Default:   1.0
  Info:      Enable (1) or disable (0) the two-population dust model.

Fragmentation velocity (cm/s)
  CLI:       -ufrag <val>
  YAML:      fragmentation_velocity
  Default:   1000.0

Fragmentation factor
  CLI:       -ffrag <val>
  YAML:      fragmentation_factor
  Default:   0.37


------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DISK PARAMETERS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Number of grid points
  CLI:       -n <val>
  YAML:      number_of_grid_points
  Default:   2000

Inner radius (AU)
  CLI:       -ri <val>
  YAML:      inner_radius_au
  Default:   1.0

Outer radius (AU)
  CLI:       -ro <val>
  YAML:      outer_radius_au
  Default:   100.0

Gas surface density at 1 AU (M_sun/AU^2)
  CLI:       -sigma0_init <val>
  YAML:      initial_gas_sigma0_msun_per_au2
  Default:   0.0

Total disk mass (M_sun)
  CLI:       -disk_mass <val>
  YAML:      disk_mass_gas
  Default:   0.0
  Info:      Mutually exclusive with sigma0_init.

Surface density exponent p
  CLI:       -index_init <val>
  YAML:      sigma_profile_exponent
  Default:   0.5

Alpha viscosity
  CLI:       -alpha_init <val>
  YAML:      alpha_viscosity
  Default:   0.01

Stellar mass (M_sun)
  CLI:       -stellar_mass <val>
  YAML:      star_mass_msun
  Default:   1.0

Aspect ratio at 1 AU (H/R)
  CLI:       -h_init <val>
  YAML:      aspect_ratio_at_1au
  Default:   0.05

Flaring index
  CLI:       -flind_init <val>
  YAML:      flaring_index
  Default:   0.0

Density floor
  CLI:       -density_floor <val>
  YAML:      density_floor
  Default:   1e-12


------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DEAD ZONE PARAMETERS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Inner dead-zone radius (AU)
  CLI:       -rdzei <val>
  YAML:      deadzone_inner_radius_au
  Default:   0.0

Outer dead-zone radius (AU)
  CLI:       -rdzeo <val>
  YAML:      deadzone_outer_radius_au
  Default:   0.0

Inner transition width multiplier
  CLI:       -drdzei <val>
  YAML:      deadzone_inner_transition_width_mult
  Default:   0.0

Outer transition width multiplier
  CLI:       -drdzeo <val>
  YAML:      deadzone_outer_transition_width_mult
  Default:   0.0

Alpha reduction inside dead zone
  CLI:       -amod <val>
  YAML:      deadzone_alpha_reduction
  Default:   0.0


------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DUST PARAMETERS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Number of dust particles
  CLI:       -ndust <val>
  YAML:      number_of_dust_particles
  Default:   5000

Dust-to-gas ratio
  CLI:       -eps <val>
  YAML:      initial_dust_to_gas_ratio
  Default:   0.01

Population 1 mass ratio
  CLI:       -ratio <val>
  YAML:      population_one_mass_ratio
  Default:   0.85

Micro-grain size (cm)
  CLI:       -micsize <val>
  YAML:      micro_particle_size_cm
  Default:   1e-4

Large-grain size (cm)
  CLI:       -largesize <val>
  YAML:      one_size_particle_value_cm
  Default:   0.0

Dust material density (g/cm^3)
  CLI:       -pdensity <val>
  YAML:      dust_particle_density_g_cm3
  Default:   1.6

Dust smoothing kernel
  CLI:       -dust_smoothing <cic|ngp|tophat|gaussian>
  YAML:      dust_smoothing_mode
  Default:   cic

Gaussian kernel width (grid units)
  CLI:       -gaussian_sigma_grid_units <val>
  YAML:      gaussian_smoothing_sigma_grid_units
  Default:   1.0

Gaussian cutoff (σ units)
  CLI:       -gaussian_cutoff_sigma <val>
  YAML:      gaussian_smoothing_cutoff_sigma
  Default:   3.0


------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TIME PARAMETERS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Fixed timestep
  CLI:       -tStep <val>
  YAML:      fixed_time_step
  Default:   0.0

Total simulation time
  CLI:       -tmax <val>
  YAML:      total_simulation_time
  Default:   1e6

Output frequency
  CLI:       -outfreq <val>
  YAML:      output_write_frequency
  Default:   1000


------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FILE I/O
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Input file
  CLI:       -i <file>
  YAML:      input_file_path
  Default:   (empty)

Output directory
  CLI:       -o <dir>
  YAML:      output_directory_name
  Default:   output

Output format
  CLI:       -ascii | -hdf5 | --output-format <ascii|hdf5>
  YAML:      output_format
  Default:   ascii


------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PHOTOEVAPORATION
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Enable photoevaporation
  CLI:       -photoevap <0|1>
  YAML:      enable_photoevaporation
  Default:   0

Model selection
  CLI:       -photoevap_mode <Owen|Picogna|None>
  YAML:      photoevaporation_mode
  Default:   None

X-ray luminosity (erg/s)
  CLI:       -xray_luminosity <val>
  YAML:      xray_luminosity_erg_s
  Default:   1e30


------------------------------------------------------------------------------
INITIAL CONDITION PROFILES
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Enable cutoff profile
  CLI:       -cutoff <0|1>
  YAML:      use_cutoff_for_gas
  Default:   0

Cutoff radius (AU)
  CLI:       -cutoff_radius <val>
  YAML:      characteristic_cutoff_radius_au
  Default:   30.0

Cutoff sharpness
  CLI:       -cutoff_sharpness <val>
  YAML:      cutoff_sharpness_factor
  Default:   1.5


------------------------------------------------------------------------------
BOUNDARY CONDITIONS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Inner boundary condition
  CLI:       -inner_bc <name>
  YAML:      inner_boundary_condition
  Default:   zero_gradient

Outer boundary condition
  CLI:       -outer_bc <name>
  YAML:      outer_boundary_condition
  Default:   parabolic

Available names:
  zero_gradient
  parabolic
  fixed_flux
  absorbing
  reflecting
  linear_extrapolation
  loggrid


------------------------------------------------------------------------------
LOGGING & PANELS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Verbose logging
  CLI:       -v (INFO), -vv (DEBUG)
  YAML:      verbose
  Default:   0

Disable live terminal panels
  CLI:       -no_panels
  YAML:      disable_panels
  Default:   false


------------------------------------------------------------------------------
BENCHMARK / TEST MODES
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Run internal benchmark
  CLI:       -test <mass_test|ring_viscosity|photoevap_flux>
  YAML:      test_mode
  Default:   none

In test modes:
  Dust drift, growth, and secondary population are automatically disabled.
